00:00:54.988 --> 00:00:58.358 size:53% position:73% line:53%
devant le premier ministre.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:59.559 size:53% position:73% line:53%
JAGMEET SINGH, chef,

00:00:57.457 --> 00:01:00.794 size:53% position:73% line:53%
Nouveau Parti démocratique

00:00:58.691 --> 00:01:02.028 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Ce n'est pas du tout

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.263 size:53% position:73% line:53%
