00:01:11.972 --> 00:01:15.342 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Mais on commence

00:01:13.206 --> 00:01:16.576 size:53% position:73% line:53%
avec une bonne volonté,

00:01:14.441 --> 00:01:17.811 size:53% position:73% line:53%
