00:01:30.523 --> 00:01:33.893 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Le Bloc estime que

00:01:31.758 --> 00:01:35.128 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les provinces, comme le Québec,

00:01:32.992 --> 00:01:36.363 size:53% position:73% line:53%
sont les grandes perdantes.

00:01:34.227 --> 00:01:37.597 size:53% position:73% line:53%
YVES-FRANÇOIS BLANCHET,

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:38.832 size:53% position:73% line:53%
chef, Bloc québécois

00:01:36.696 --> 00:01:40.066 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Je comprends que la base

00:01:37.931 --> 00:01:41.301 size:53% position:73% line:53%
