00:01:39.165 --> 00:01:42.535 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les juridictions du Québec

00:01:40.400 --> 00:01:43.770 size:53% position:73% line:53%
et des provinces en matière

00:01:41.634 --> 00:01:45.004 size:53% position:73% line:53%
