00:01:42.869 --> 00:01:46.239 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'assurance médicaments.

00:01:44.104 --> 00:01:47.474 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Avec la stabilité que procure

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.708 size:53% position:73% line:53%
