00:01:52.745 --> 00:01:56.116 size:53% position:73% line:53%
d'opposition en Chambre,

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.350 size:53% position:73% line:53%
les bloquistes viennent dennente

00:01:55.215 --> 00:01:58.585 size:53% position:73% line:53%
perdre un levier de négociation

00:01:56.449 --> 00:01:59.786 size:53% position:73% line:53%
important; les conservateurs,

00:01:57.684 --> 00:02:01.020 size:53% position:73% line:53%
eux, une chance à court terme

00:01:58.918 --> 00:02:01.521 size:53% position:73% line:53%
